---
description: Repository conventions for the enterprise portal
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---
- Work in repository root; never nest a duplicate repo.
- Conventional Commits; keep the tree buildable after each phase.
- Never commit secrets, `.env`, `node_modules`, `target`, `dist`, or coverage.
- Update PROGRESS.md, NEXT-STEPS.md, QUALITY-GATES.md with evidence.
- API contract lives in `contracts/openapi/portal-v1.yaml`.
